  border-top:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt"> <p class="Para"><span lang="EN-CA">2. <u>Non-pecuniary Loss</u></span></p> </td> 
      <td width="297" valign="top" style="width:222.9pt;border-top:none;border-left:
