  border-top:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt"> <p class="Para"><span lang="EN-CA">—compensation for physical and mental pain and suffering endured and to be endured, loss of amenities and enjoyment of life, loss of expectation of life</span></p> </td> 
      <td width="297" valign="top" style="width:222.9pt;border-top:none;border-left:
  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt"> <p class="Para"><span lang="EN-CA">&nbsp;</span></p> <p class="Para"><span lang="EN-CA">&nbsp;</span></p> <p class="Para"><span lang="EN-CA">&nbsp;</span></p> <p class="Para"><span lang="EN-CA">100,000</span></p> </td> 
     </tr> 
     <tr> 
      <td width="297" valign="top" style="width:222.9pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  border-top:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt"> <p class="Para"><span lang="EN-CA">Total General Damages</span></p> </td> 
      <td width="297" valign="top" style="width:222.9pt;border-top:none;border-left:
  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt"> <p class="Para"><span lang="EN-CA">$741,413</span></p> </td> 
